From: phoenix port <fix@me>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix: enable Venus video codec

Enable the video codec node and point it at the split-MDT firmware
extracted from the stock vendor partition (shipped in the
firmware-xiaomi-phoenix package).  Driver support for the
"qcom,sm7150-venus" compatible lands in a separate patch.

venus_mem reservation inherited from sm7150.dtsi.

Signed-off-by: phoenix port <fix@me>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
@@ -345,6 +345,10 @@
 };
 
 &venus {
+	status = "okay";
+
+	/* Firmware split MDT straight from stock vendor partition, already
+	 * shipped in firmware-xiaomi-phoenix. */
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sm7150/phoenix/venus.mbn";
 };
 
